WEBVTT

01:41.729 --> 01:49.020
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.470 --> 01:51.900
[Episode 10]

01:56.920 --> 01:57.759
Everyone.

01:57.950 --> 02:00.480
I have something very important
to announce.

02:00.840 --> 02:02.680
Our school is about to hold

02:02.680 --> 02:04.060
its 50th-anniversary celebration.

02:04.060 --> 02:05.550
Every class has to put on a performance.

02:05.550 --> 02:08.060
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

02:07.510 --> 02:08.150
Yes.

02:08.870 --> 02:10.150
It's very important.

02:10.630 --> 02:12.870
We must pass the school committee's
preliminary selection first.

02:12.870 --> 02:14.800
There will be about 10 performances.

02:14.800 --> 02:16.150
Classes will compete for the spots.

02:16.150 --> 02:18.030
But it's not mandatory.
It's completely voluntary.

02:18.030 --> 02:18.750
All right?

02:18.750 --> 02:19.430
Tang Tingting,

02:19.430 --> 02:20.360
you organize this.

02:20.300 --> 02:22.880
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

02:20.360 --> 02:21.030
Okay.

02:21.630 --> 02:22.829
Take this seriously.

02:25.840 --> 02:27.400
Everyone, everyone.

02:27.400 --> 02:30.120
This is a great chance
to go down in school history.

02:30.120 --> 02:31.150
What talents do you have?

02:31.150 --> 02:32.400
Let me coordinate.

02:32.430 --> 02:33.360
Me, me!

02:35.870 --> 02:37.430
I have lots of talents.

02:38.800 --> 02:39.710
Come on.

02:39.710 --> 02:41.280
You've been tone-deaf
since you were a kid.

02:41.280 --> 02:42.150
Just play basketball

02:42.150 --> 02:43.750
and be a good sports student.

02:44.750 --> 02:46.680
Arts and sports go hand in hand.

02:47.190 --> 02:49.240
Even if I, Duan Qiyan, don't say a word,

02:49.240 --> 02:50.470
just standing there,

02:50.750 --> 02:52.870
I am a beautiful sight.

02:55.710 --> 02:56.750
Why the booing?

02:56.750 --> 02:58.240
Am I not handsome?

02:58.690 --> 02:59.630
Duan Qiyan.

03:00.030 --> 03:01.840
Why don't you perform a sketch

03:02.240 --> 03:04.120
called "Narcissism"?

03:04.750 --> 03:05.630
Shoo!

03:07.120 --> 03:08.150
Stop joking around, guys.

03:08.150 --> 03:10.120
Be serious. This is important.

03:11.470 --> 03:12.680
But hasn't the experimental class

03:12.680 --> 03:14.740
always skipped these performances?

03:15.120 --> 03:16.560
That's exactly why we should participate.

03:16.560 --> 03:18.630
We should be
a different experimental class.

03:18.630 --> 03:20.760
Who says we only know how to take tests?

03:22.710 --> 03:24.800
Tingting, you're taking this so seriously.

03:24.800 --> 03:26.750
Are you competing
with Zhao Shuran from Class 3

03:26.750 --> 03:28.190
again?

03:28.470 --> 03:29.840
After all, you've been competing
since junior high

03:29.840 --> 03:31.240
up until now.

03:32.710 --> 03:35.520
No, I keep personal
and public matters separate, okay?

03:35.520 --> 03:37.000
I really want our experimental class

03:37.000 --> 03:39.400
to do well
in this kind of activity for once.

03:39.680 --> 03:42.210
Who says good students
only know how to study?

03:42.750 --> 03:44.560
W-With your grades?

03:50.030 --> 03:52.000
The 10th graders are quite active.

03:52.000 --> 03:53.730
Every class has a performance.

03:53.800 --> 03:55.030
This 50th-anniversary celebration

03:55.030 --> 03:57.280
is indeed a great chance to perform.

03:57.840 --> 03:59.750
Miss, this is ours.

04:05.240 --> 04:07.100
Tingting, what about your class?

04:11.590 --> 04:12.750
I...

04:13.030 --> 04:14.030
We...

04:14.910 --> 04:15.750
It's blank?

04:16.390 --> 04:19.040
Don't tell me your class
doesn't have a single performance.

04:19.040 --> 04:19.920
Makes sense.

04:20.310 --> 04:23.510
Your experimental class
just needs to focus on studying.

04:27.430 --> 04:29.240
Who says we don't have one?

04:29.390 --> 04:30.870
We have too many ideas

04:30.870 --> 04:32.150
we can't even choose.

04:33.000 --> 04:33.800
Teacher.

04:33.800 --> 04:35.240
We'll do an internal screening first.

04:35.240 --> 04:36.480
Just look forward to it.

04:36.480 --> 04:37.240
Sure.

04:45.600 --> 04:48.430
What kind of performance should we do?

04:48.870 --> 04:49.680
Help me think of something.

04:49.680 --> 04:51.540
I really can't think of anything.

04:52.560 --> 04:54.480
Even though you and Zhao Shuran

04:54.480 --> 04:56.409
were bitter rivals in junior high,

04:56.680 --> 04:58.120
we're already in high school now,

04:58.120 --> 04:59.240
and you aren't in the same class.

04:59.240 --> 05:01.370
Why is she still giving you a hard time?

05:03.190 --> 05:05.630
Why are you two rivals?

05:07.270 --> 05:09.330
It shouldn't be about grades, right?

05:09.480 --> 05:10.630
How is that possible?

05:10.630 --> 05:12.980
It's over their idols.

05:14.540 --> 05:17.070
Really?
Fighting over people you don't know?

05:17.690 --> 05:19.610
No, no, no. There's more to it.

05:19.630 --> 05:20.450
Right.

05:20.570 --> 05:22.060
Since school started,

05:22.060 --> 05:24.060
they've been fighting
to lead the morning exercises

05:24.060 --> 05:26.330
and the eye exercises.

05:26.980 --> 05:28.300
Anyway...

05:29.010 --> 05:31.070
Zhao Shuran and Tingting are rivals.

05:35.130 --> 05:36.570
That's so interesting.

05:36.570 --> 05:38.430
And looking at the situation now,

05:38.570 --> 05:40.630
it's no longer about personal honor.

05:40.659 --> 05:41.980
It is now

05:41.980 --> 05:44.040
a battle to defend our class's honor.

05:45.930 --> 05:47.390
Fight for the collective.

05:48.370 --> 05:49.430
Then I support you.

05:50.500 --> 05:51.550
Spiritually.

05:56.010 --> 05:57.220
Let me remind you,

05:57.890 --> 06:00.570
tomorrow is the deadline for sign-ups.

06:02.740 --> 06:04.660
I've already talked big,

06:04.660 --> 06:06.720
so we have to put on a show this time...

06:07.250 --> 06:08.580
and blow everyone away!

06:10.690 --> 06:11.550
Arms wide open.

06:11.800 --> 06:15.390
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

06:15.390 --> 06:19.810
Two, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

06:21.330 --> 06:22.180
Look at them.

06:22.180 --> 06:23.540
They are so in sync.

06:24.060 --> 06:25.130
Looking at it this way,

06:25.130 --> 06:26.590
they're pretty cool, huh?

06:27.540 --> 06:29.420
Five, six, seven, eight.

06:29.420 --> 06:30.770
Two, two...

06:31.060 --> 06:32.330
In sync?

06:33.330 --> 06:34.130
Cool?

06:34.740 --> 06:36.470
Get ready to change direction.

06:36.560 --> 06:41.270
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

06:58.500 --> 06:59.570
A boy group dance?

07:01.570 --> 07:02.770
The three of us?

07:08.180 --> 07:09.710
Do you two know how to dance?

07:12.010 --> 07:13.620
Y-You do?

07:19.300 --> 07:21.100
I've never even seen one before.

07:22.450 --> 07:23.250
Beautiful.

07:23.370 --> 07:24.700
It's really beautiful.

07:24.730 --> 07:25.810
This is the trendiest

07:25.810 --> 07:27.340
formation dance right now.

07:27.500 --> 07:29.330
It's easy to learn,
dance in sync, and is cool.

07:29.330 --> 07:30.980
When I saw you guys
warming up over there just now,

07:30.980 --> 07:31.770
you were so in sync.

07:31.770 --> 07:33.170
You can definitely do it.

07:33.180 --> 07:34.060
Sis,

07:34.330 --> 07:35.130
our warm-up

07:35.130 --> 07:36.990
is nothing like a boy group dance.

07:37.540 --> 07:39.540
Please, guys.

07:39.770 --> 07:40.690
We absolutely cannot

07:40.690 --> 07:42.659
let Zhao Shuran make a joke out of us.

07:42.659 --> 07:44.450
Right now, the most reliable option

07:44.450 --> 07:45.420
is you guys.

07:46.690 --> 07:48.370
If we really participate,

07:48.690 --> 07:50.500
that would be the biggest joke.

07:50.860 --> 07:52.100
Just give it a try.

07:52.690 --> 07:54.620
Zhixia, please help me persuade them.

07:54.620 --> 07:56.060
Please.

07:56.890 --> 07:58.300
J-J-J-J-Jiang Yubai.

08:15.570 --> 08:16.570
Why are you

08:16.810 --> 08:18.420
s-s-s-s-stuttering?

08:27.060 --> 08:27.860
Well...

08:28.370 --> 08:30.740
Don't you still owe Lin Zhixia your life?

08:30.740 --> 08:32.409
This is a good chance to pay her back.

08:32.409 --> 08:33.100
What's going on?

08:33.100 --> 08:34.700
That's a big change in attitude.

08:34.700 --> 08:35.700
What's the trick?

08:36.169 --> 08:38.940
So what do you say?

08:40.370 --> 08:42.340
Did you agree?

08:47.860 --> 08:49.460
Shen Fuxuan, what about you?

08:52.050 --> 08:53.340
With the both of them around,

08:53.340 --> 08:55.170
I won't be the worst one.

08:55.170 --> 08:55.980
Yes!

08:55.980 --> 08:58.250
Now we're only short of two people
to complete the team.

08:58.250 --> 08:59.710
I'll go look around again.

09:08.740 --> 09:09.620
Classmates,

09:10.340 --> 09:13.010
since we signed up
for this school anniversary performance,

09:13.010 --> 09:14.700
our experimental class

09:14.720 --> 09:17.580
must beat
all the other performances in the school.

09:17.700 --> 09:18.300
All right.

09:18.960 --> 09:20.820
Now let me teach you how to dance.

09:22.140 --> 09:24.400
[Dream OK]

09:24.080 --> 09:25.510
♪ To me, say hi ♪

09:24.650 --> 09:25.410
Rub.

09:25.930 --> 09:27.380
♪ Open your heart quickly ♪

09:26.220 --> 09:28.150
Open and close. Snap your fingers.

09:28.250 --> 09:28.860
Dust it off.

09:28.360 --> 09:29.880
♪ To me, say hi ♪

09:28.860 --> 09:30.220
Your shoes are dirty. Dust it off.

09:30.220 --> 09:31.050
Twist.

09:30.490 --> 09:32.230
♪ We share the same dream ♪

09:32.600 --> 09:36.810
♪ How lucky I am to have you
always by my side ♪

09:37.310 --> 09:41.390
♪ Like a wave lifting a boat ♪

09:41.820 --> 09:44.310
♪ Riding the wind to the sky ♪

10:03.530 --> 10:04.220
Stop!

10:04.860 --> 10:06.460
What's this you're dancing?

10:06.460 --> 10:07.980
Your postures are terrible.

10:07.980 --> 10:09.890
You'll never become
a boy group in your lifetime.

10:09.890 --> 10:11.740
Tang Tingting, just let us off the hook.

10:11.740 --> 10:13.580
We haven't received
any professional training.

10:13.580 --> 10:15.580
It's good enough
that we can remember the moves.

10:15.580 --> 10:16.410
That's right.

10:16.910 --> 10:18.580
This is a formation dance.

10:18.890 --> 10:19.720
Formation moves

10:19.720 --> 10:21.870
should be as neat as a full array.

10:21.940 --> 10:23.460
Not a single posture can be wrong.

10:23.460 --> 10:25.370
You guys are dancing so messily.

10:25.460 --> 10:25.890
If people didn't know,

10:25.890 --> 10:29.090
they would think
you were a group of scattered deserters.

10:32.610 --> 10:33.410
It's fine.

10:34.860 --> 10:36.290
If this doesn't wory,

10:36.620 --> 10:37.950
we can find another way.

10:43.010 --> 10:43.890
I

10:44.050 --> 10:47.170
once at the Cultural Festival of
the Normal University Affiliated Primary School,

10:47.170 --> 10:49.940
played a very important role,

10:49.960 --> 10:52.530
and won the unanimous praise

10:52.650 --> 10:55.170
of all the teachers and students
in the school.

10:55.170 --> 10:56.370
Shut up.

10:56.370 --> 10:58.940
That performance was called
"The Child on Horseback."

10:58.940 --> 11:00.740
He played the horse in it.

11:00.940 --> 11:02.050
He even used a cardboard

11:02.050 --> 11:03.370
to make a horse head
and put it on his head.

11:03.370 --> 11:04.480
If the host hadn't said

11:04.480 --> 11:05.370
that Duan Qiyan was in this performance,

11:05.370 --> 11:07.700
I wouldn't have realized
it was him at all.

11:07.740 --> 11:09.600
You talk too much, Tang Tingting.

11:17.820 --> 11:19.410
I'm exhausted.

11:20.820 --> 11:21.620
Damn.

11:22.980 --> 11:23.890
Don't go.

11:23.890 --> 11:24.650
Come.

11:30.820 --> 11:31.980
Their dancing

11:31.980 --> 11:34.220
is much better than ours.

11:35.460 --> 11:36.410
Look at those

11:36.410 --> 11:37.070
dance moves

11:37.130 --> 11:38.130
and their

11:39.290 --> 11:40.010
figures.

11:42.370 --> 11:43.740
Okay, pause at this move.

11:43.740 --> 11:44.890
This is so beautiful.

11:44.890 --> 11:46.420
We can't compete with this.

11:47.770 --> 11:49.080
Which class is the one in the middle from?

11:49.080 --> 11:50.050
Do you know her?

11:50.530 --> 11:51.890
-Please introduce her to me.
-Okay, everyone.

11:51.890 --> 11:53.550
Be serious. Let's do it again.

11:59.190 --> 12:00.580
I'm so mad.

12:01.170 --> 12:03.430
I absolutely cannot lose to Zhao Shuran.

12:04.410 --> 12:05.770
Stop looking. Let's go.

12:05.790 --> 12:06.840
Let's go.

12:06.860 --> 12:08.010
Let's go.

12:11.770 --> 12:13.220
Two hours.

12:13.340 --> 12:15.100
A whole two hours,

12:15.190 --> 12:16.860
and you still can't get
a single measure right.

12:16.860 --> 12:18.700
Even a pig
would have learned it if I taught it.

12:18.700 --> 12:20.760
You idiots who only know how to study!

12:24.460 --> 12:26.520
The thought of losing to Zhao Shuran—

12:27.170 --> 12:29.290
and losing so terribly at it—

12:30.130 --> 12:32.250
makes me not want to go to school anymore.

12:32.250 --> 12:33.510
We have so many people.

12:33.770 --> 12:36.630
We are capable of thinking of
another performance.

12:38.170 --> 12:39.290
Lin Zhixia.

12:39.460 --> 12:40.770
You're smart.

12:40.980 --> 12:42.290
As our head planner,

12:42.290 --> 12:43.050
you have to help me

12:43.050 --> 12:44.620
put this show together.

12:55.010 --> 12:56.370
So, tell me everyone,

12:56.370 --> 12:57.530
what can you all do?

12:58.740 --> 13:00.250
I know Jiang Yubai can play the piano.

13:00.250 --> 13:01.710
What about the rest of you?

13:01.770 --> 13:03.380
Any other special talents?

13:04.220 --> 13:05.250
I can play Go.

13:06.130 --> 13:07.820
You can't perform Go on stage.

13:08.410 --> 13:09.250
What else?

13:10.460 --> 13:11.720
I can play the clapper.

13:14.290 --> 13:16.010
I can play the cello.

13:17.170 --> 13:18.300
I can play the drums.

13:21.250 --> 13:23.250
So many of you can play instruments.

13:29.500 --> 13:30.770
Let's form a band then!

13:36.340 --> 13:37.130
A band?

13:37.170 --> 13:38.230
That's a good idea.

13:38.340 --> 13:40.580
Jiang Yubai can be the keyboardist,

13:40.820 --> 13:42.420
and Shen Fuxuan the drummer.

13:42.770 --> 13:44.100
I'll be the lead singer.

13:44.500 --> 13:46.940
Then we're still missing...

13:48.340 --> 13:50.100
The bass and cello

13:50.100 --> 13:51.170
both have four strings.

13:51.170 --> 13:52.290
The notes are the same.

13:52.290 --> 13:53.290
I can give it a try.

13:53.420 --> 13:54.530
Wait, no need.

13:54.920 --> 13:56.860
You just stick to your cello.

13:57.410 --> 13:58.980
I can play the bass!

14:01.530 --> 14:03.330
Since when can you play the bass?

14:03.740 --> 14:05.740
I grew up with you.

14:05.890 --> 14:07.290
If you could really play the bass,

14:07.290 --> 14:08.740
with your love for bragging,

14:08.740 --> 14:09.940
wouldn't you have told us
you've performed at

14:09.940 --> 14:11.400
the Golden Hall in Vienna?

14:13.290 --> 14:15.940
I just didn't have a chance
to perform bass.

14:16.860 --> 14:19.250
You can sing and play the guitar, right?

14:19.770 --> 14:21.620
You can sing and play the piano, right?

14:21.620 --> 14:24.620
When have you ever seen someone
sing and play the bass?

14:25.700 --> 14:26.650
Besides,

14:28.620 --> 14:29.740
I am a person

14:30.100 --> 14:32.460
who is naturally modest and low-key.

14:34.940 --> 14:36.460
All right, don't make a fuss.

14:36.460 --> 14:37.820
In short,

14:38.130 --> 14:38.890
when the time comes,

14:38.890 --> 14:41.010
just see how well I do.

14:43.580 --> 14:44.220
All right!

14:44.740 --> 14:47.530
Then we are just short of a guitarist.

14:47.700 --> 14:48.960
I'll take care of that.

14:49.290 --> 14:50.050
Great!

14:50.050 --> 14:51.580
We have a new performance then!

14:51.580 --> 14:53.220
Our band will definitely

14:53.220 --> 14:54.480
set the campus on fire!

15:19.650 --> 15:22.050
Is this guitarist you invited reliable?

15:22.980 --> 15:24.000
Don't worry.

15:24.000 --> 15:25.240
Absolutely reliable.

15:25.240 --> 15:26.510
Although I haven't met him,

15:26.510 --> 15:28.820
he is the champion of the Hellfire Guitar

15:28.820 --> 15:29.960
Solo Competition.

15:34.440 --> 15:35.240
What's wrong?

15:35.940 --> 15:36.870
What did you say?

15:38.410 --> 15:40.820
The Hellfire Guitar Solo Competition.

15:40.840 --> 15:42.170
The previous sentence.

15:45.120 --> 15:46.650
Although I haven't met him.

15:51.740 --> 15:53.370
We're internet friends.

15:53.700 --> 15:56.130
It's normal that we haven't met.

16:00.940 --> 16:01.650
By the way,

16:01.860 --> 16:02.650
if he comes later,

16:02.650 --> 16:04.380
we still need to be a bit formal.

16:05.010 --> 16:06.980
Has our band not been named yet?

16:07.740 --> 16:08.820
Let's name it now.

16:15.200 --> 16:16.600
How about "Class Break"?

16:17.320 --> 16:18.320
It gives the feeling

16:18.320 --> 16:20.440
of using the precious 10-minute Class Break

16:20.440 --> 16:22.570
in the midst of your busy and stressful

16:22.600 --> 16:23.630
student life to do

16:23.630 --> 16:24.960
what you like and love.

16:28.270 --> 16:29.270
That's a good one.

16:38.990 --> 16:40.840
Bro, your bass.

16:46.960 --> 16:49.600
This bass is really nice.

16:58.870 --> 16:59.670
Boss,

17:01.750 --> 17:04.270
which of these four strings is Do?

17:17.290 --> 17:18.010
Wind?

17:19.069 --> 17:19.960
Are you Wind?

17:27.000 --> 17:28.920
Burst, reality.

17:29.920 --> 17:31.720
Shatter, spirit.

17:31.760 --> 17:33.070
Banish...

17:33.200 --> 17:34.550
This world.

17:36.720 --> 17:38.310
Angel's Tears?

17:38.900 --> 17:40.300
How did you know it was me?

17:41.720 --> 17:44.120
You dress exactly
like your QQ Show avatar.

17:57.550 --> 17:58.350
He's so cool.

17:58.980 --> 18:01.310
He looks the part.

18:01.470 --> 18:02.870
Let's observe a bit more.

18:07.000 --> 18:08.240
What would you like to drink?

18:08.240 --> 18:08.900
No, thanks.

18:09.590 --> 18:10.790
Let's cut to the chase

18:10.920 --> 18:12.120
and talk about music.

18:12.960 --> 18:13.530
Okay.

18:14.030 --> 18:15.110
Our band's name

18:15.110 --> 18:15.920
is Class Break.

18:15.920 --> 18:16.790
I'm the lead singer,

18:16.790 --> 18:17.880
and this is the keyboardist.

18:17.880 --> 18:19.550
This is our band manager, Lin Zhixia.

18:19.550 --> 18:21.610
Now, we're just missing a guitarist.

18:22.550 --> 18:24.110
What genre do you play?

18:24.690 --> 18:25.720
C-pop.

18:26.640 --> 18:27.480
What's that?

18:53.350 --> 18:54.510
Thanks. Thanks.

18:56.110 --> 18:57.590
What genre do you like?

18:57.920 --> 18:59.380
We are open to discussion.

19:00.370 --> 19:01.770
Open to discussion, huh?

19:02.230 --> 19:02.960
Okay.

19:04.370 --> 19:05.980
Then let me show you

19:06.740 --> 19:07.800
what real music is.

19:22.070 --> 19:24.880
Rock never dies!

19:31.480 --> 19:32.920
I... I'm the guitarist.

19:33.270 --> 19:35.130
The lead singer isn't here, so...

19:37.660 --> 19:38.660
Will this song do?

19:45.000 --> 19:47.160
If we perform "Rock Never Dies"
at the school anniversary,

19:47.160 --> 19:48.110
we'll die first.

19:48.440 --> 19:49.400
Yeah.

19:49.740 --> 19:51.440
Can we change to a song

19:51.440 --> 19:53.030
that isn't so hardcore?

19:53.480 --> 19:55.400
Not so hardcore means...

19:55.940 --> 19:56.570
Pop rock?

19:59.290 --> 20:00.030
Hey.

20:00.030 --> 20:02.350
I know it might be too simple for you,

20:02.350 --> 20:03.480
but pop rock

20:03.480 --> 20:04.740
is already hard for us.

20:07.710 --> 20:08.710
Here's the thing.

20:09.190 --> 20:11.240
I'm in the heavy metal scene.

20:11.430 --> 20:13.160
I don't play mainstream music.

20:13.440 --> 20:14.850
If my peers knew

20:14.880 --> 20:17.200
I performed pop songs at your school,

20:17.650 --> 20:19.110
it would be embarrassing.

20:19.870 --> 20:20.630
Forget it.

20:20.660 --> 20:21.720
Find someone else.

20:21.780 --> 20:22.780
How about this?

20:23.510 --> 20:25.370
Just treat it as a commercial gig.

20:25.530 --> 20:27.570
We'll pay you 200.

20:29.320 --> 20:30.080
200?

20:33.160 --> 20:33.920
Outside,

20:33.960 --> 20:36.400
my appearance fee is 600.

20:38.090 --> 20:39.290
I sing 8 songs a night.

20:40.640 --> 20:41.950
Your 200...

20:42.160 --> 20:44.120
Bro, with us,

20:44.140 --> 20:45.860
you get 200 for 1 song.

20:46.030 --> 20:48.110
Outside, you average 75 a song.

20:51.350 --> 20:52.390
Is that so?

20:58.320 --> 21:00.520
You guys... you're doing 1 song, right?

21:02.790 --> 21:03.560
All right.

21:04.480 --> 21:06.370
Find a good song

21:06.420 --> 21:07.950
and send me the sheet music.

21:08.860 --> 21:09.860
That's 200, okay?

21:27.790 --> 21:29.110
Why is there no sound?

21:32.430 --> 21:34.200
I'm playing it right.

21:44.350 --> 21:45.480
Duan Qiyan!

21:45.970 --> 21:46.970
I'm telling you,

21:47.000 --> 21:48.240
if you play it again,

21:48.240 --> 21:50.350
get out of here with your bass!

21:50.350 --> 21:51.110
Dad!

21:51.160 --> 21:52.400
Don't break my bass.

21:52.400 --> 21:53.510
I rented it.

22:03.140 --> 22:04.030
Attention, everyone.

22:04.030 --> 22:06.400
This question
will definitely be in the exam.

22:06.400 --> 22:07.810
As time goes by,

22:07.830 --> 22:09.030
the speed decreases.

22:09.110 --> 22:09.810
As we know,

22:09.810 --> 22:11.640
this is a downward deceleration of a.

22:11.640 --> 22:13.000
Then for line d,

22:13.590 --> 22:14.550
let's analyze

22:14.790 --> 22:16.980
what its state is.

22:22.400 --> 22:24.600
How is it going, Committee Member Tang?

22:24.790 --> 22:26.400
The performance of our class

22:26.400 --> 22:28.500
is already very mature.

22:28.640 --> 22:31.070
I'm considering whether to enrich

22:31.070 --> 22:32.310
the form of the dance.

22:32.470 --> 22:34.920
For instance,
adding poetry recitation to the dance.

22:34.920 --> 22:36.450
Will it be more impressive?

22:37.590 --> 22:39.070
Now my mind is full of

22:39.070 --> 22:40.510
these things every day.

22:40.640 --> 22:42.100
It's giving me a headache.

22:44.720 --> 22:45.580
I heard

22:45.720 --> 22:46.720
your class's boy group dance

22:46.720 --> 22:47.750
screwed up.

22:47.920 --> 22:50.980
What new performance
are you preparing to change it to?

22:54.110 --> 22:56.550
Tang Tingting, I'm talking to you!

22:58.550 --> 22:59.720
So rude.

23:12.700 --> 23:14.080
[Dance is the hidden language of the soul]

23:17.680 --> 23:18.510
Stop.

23:18.680 --> 23:19.590
Stop.

23:21.550 --> 23:22.610
We can't rehearse.

23:23.030 --> 23:23.790
What's wrong, bro?

23:23.790 --> 23:24.550
We can't.

23:26.960 --> 23:28.160
The bass is terrible.

23:28.830 --> 23:31.090
The pitch is all wrong. Can't you hear it?

23:32.750 --> 23:34.200
Bro, teach me.

23:32.930 --> 23:34.580
[Dance is the hidden language of the soul]

23:34.200 --> 23:35.110
I'll practice more.

23:35.110 --> 23:36.640
It's not about practicing.

23:36.640 --> 23:37.680
In a band,

23:37.680 --> 23:40.010
if the bass is a mess,
everything is a mess.

23:40.160 --> 23:42.160
It's better not to have one, really.

23:48.350 --> 23:49.810
We can't do without a bass.

23:49.960 --> 23:51.200
If the bass and the cello

23:51.200 --> 23:52.200
are similar,

23:52.390 --> 23:53.480
I can give it a try.

24:00.390 --> 24:01.690
[Dance is the hidden language of the soul]

24:18.110 --> 24:19.200
That sounds okay.

24:19.570 --> 24:21.030
Here is someone who knows.

24:21.400 --> 24:22.790
Let her play.

24:23.920 --> 24:26.110
Bro, let me try again.

24:26.830 --> 24:27.920
Don't bother.

24:28.240 --> 24:29.830
You have no foundation.

24:29.830 --> 24:31.630
There is no time to train you now.

24:31.830 --> 24:32.790
Please teach me.

24:32.790 --> 24:33.920
I learn things quickly.

24:33.920 --> 24:34.750
Really.

24:34.750 --> 24:36.160
I only took 200 yuan.

24:36.240 --> 24:37.480
Do I have to teach you for that as well?

24:37.480 --> 24:38.590
I'll pay you more.

24:38.880 --> 24:40.720
It's not about the money. There's no need,

24:40.720 --> 24:41.440
you know?

24:42.070 --> 24:42.680
Bro,

24:42.880 --> 24:44.000
I really can't leave the band.

24:44.000 --> 24:44.640
How about

24:44.720 --> 24:46.070
you give me some other tasks?

24:46.070 --> 24:46.800
For example,

24:46.920 --> 24:48.160
triangle, hourglass,

24:48.160 --> 24:49.160
I can do anything.

24:49.750 --> 24:50.640
Forget it. Just don't

24:50.640 --> 24:52.830
delay everyone's progress, okay?

24:56.720 --> 24:57.590
Guys.

24:58.400 --> 24:59.330
Be softer today.

24:59.480 --> 25:01.480
My throat isn't feeling well today.

25:03.270 --> 25:04.110
Tingting.

25:04.640 --> 25:05.830
You've been resting for a day.

25:05.830 --> 25:07.360
Why are you still like this?

25:07.680 --> 25:08.810
I don't know either.

25:09.400 --> 25:10.510
Can you still sing?

25:11.400 --> 25:12.270
I can't talk,

25:12.510 --> 25:14.040
but I can try singing again.

25:23.550 --> 25:26.820
♪ Running to the territory
I want to explore ♪

25:30.680 --> 25:33.230
♪ Running to the territory
I want to explore ♪

25:33.350 --> 25:34.610
Stop, stop.

25:35.440 --> 25:36.240
If you ask me,

25:36.240 --> 25:37.740
let's just disband the band.

25:37.740 --> 25:38.220
Okay?

25:41.000 --> 25:42.010
No, no.

25:42.110 --> 25:44.570
My voice will be fine
after a few days of rest.

25:46.720 --> 25:48.880
Actually, looking for an outsider

25:48.880 --> 25:50.070
for your school anniversary

25:50.070 --> 25:51.750
is pretty unreal.

25:52.920 --> 25:54.750
Forget it, I won't make this money.

25:54.750 --> 25:55.480
But...

25:55.510 --> 25:57.030
Feng, this program
is really important to us—

25:57.030 --> 25:58.050
super important—

25:58.080 --> 26:00.700
really important!

26:06.240 --> 26:07.070
Jin Baihui?

26:09.110 --> 26:09.920
Excuse me.

26:10.680 --> 26:12.440
Can I have a try?

26:14.480 --> 26:15.480
You can sing?

26:17.510 --> 26:19.110
I wrote a song myself.

26:19.110 --> 26:20.770
I don't know if it's suitable.

26:23.110 --> 26:24.640
You know how to write songs?

26:26.920 --> 26:27.920
We want to listen.

26:39.290 --> 26:40.020
♪ Waiting ♪

26:40.940 --> 26:44.800
♪ Every second is patience ♪

26:45.520 --> 26:46.320
♪ Run away quickly ♪

26:46.930 --> 26:50.400
♪ Testing with ulterior motives ♪

26:50.930 --> 26:52.370
♪ If I start over ♪

26:53.520 --> 26:57.240
♪ Why not now? ♪

26:57.810 --> 26:58.510
♪ It will turn around ♪

26:59.600 --> 27:02.080
♪ Create accidents for accidents ♪

27:02.350 --> 27:03.030
It sounds good.

27:02.890 --> 27:05.250
♪ Break all fake love ♪

27:03.640 --> 27:04.500
Sounds so good.

27:09.510 --> 27:11.110
Is this really a song you wrote?

27:11.110 --> 27:12.390
What's the name?

27:12.830 --> 27:14.760
This song is called "Closed Loop."

27:15.310 --> 27:16.000
This works.

27:25.030 --> 27:25.970
Great.

27:26.000 --> 27:27.530
We have our own lead singer.

27:43.110 --> 27:43.980
[Let's build
a glorious campus dream together]

27:45.270 --> 27:47.070
Slow down. I can't understand.

27:48.480 --> 27:50.950
I said our band is complete!

27:51.090 --> 27:52.460
Okay, stop talking.

27:52.640 --> 27:53.830
Protect your voice.

27:56.210 --> 27:56.700
Wait, wait.

27:56.700 --> 27:57.160
Wait!

27:57.440 --> 27:58.070
Wait...

27:58.830 --> 28:00.030
You two wait a minute.

28:00.440 --> 28:02.510
Since Wan Chunlei is playing the bass,

28:02.510 --> 28:03.440
what do I do?

28:06.200 --> 28:07.960
Your mind is the one that's blank.

28:07.960 --> 28:08.880
I'm already on track.

28:08.880 --> 28:09.550
I don't need more—

28:09.550 --> 28:10.750
just give me a week.

28:10.750 --> 28:12.610
I promise I can practice until...

28:15.590 --> 28:16.270
Your head's going to explore?

28:16.270 --> 28:17.550
I should be the one saying that.

28:17.550 --> 28:19.350
I just ordered uniforms for our band.

28:19.350 --> 28:21.240
At least save a spot for me.

28:26.790 --> 28:28.960
Tang Tingting, I won't play a horse.

28:28.960 --> 28:30.760
If you want to, play it yourself.

28:31.160 --> 28:32.560
You can understand this?

28:32.640 --> 28:33.270
Well,

28:33.790 --> 28:35.480
you can't understand it?

28:35.750 --> 28:37.610
She was straight out scolding me.

28:47.240 --> 28:50.100
We are all looking forward
to you playing the horse.

28:51.070 --> 28:52.750
I won't play the horse.

28:52.930 --> 28:54.000
How old am I?

28:54.000 --> 28:55.330
Playing a horse for fun?

28:55.640 --> 28:57.070
Zhixia, no need to persuade me.

28:57.070 --> 28:58.070
It's impossible.

28:58.200 --> 28:59.600
Absolutely impossible!

29:11.460 --> 29:14.530
♪ The world is limitless colour puzzle ♪

29:14.780 --> 29:18.010
♪ I have the wildest dreams;
never fitting in ♪

29:18.370 --> 29:21.350
♪ The formula in my mind
is messed up and reorganized ♪

29:21.850 --> 29:24.940
♪ Is loneliness my only talent? ♪

29:25.610 --> 29:29.280
♪ Hide in the midsummer tree shade;
what's waiting for my answer? ♪

29:29.640 --> 29:31.710
♪ The breeze blows past my cheeks ♪

29:32.530 --> 29:35.300
♪ How do I solve for
the unexpected variables? ♪

29:35.770 --> 29:38.550
♪ At the most splendid moment ♪

29:39.220 --> 29:42.340
♪ Running and waiting for my exploration ♪

29:42.620 --> 29:45.580
♪ The unknown is so fascinating ♪

29:46.100 --> 29:48.270
♪ Young me stood on tiptoes ♪

29:48.740 --> 29:52.720
♪ Everything is transparent;
time is too light ♪

29:53.060 --> 29:56.210
♪ Natural deduction;
the answer is clear in an instant ♪

29:56.440 --> 29:59.390
♪ The timer is still counting down
3, 2, 1 ♪

29:59.660 --> 30:02.140
♪ The best answer is within our reach ♪

30:02.470 --> 30:05.100
♪ How should I define ♪

30:05.480 --> 30:06.320
♪ You and me ♪

30:06.820 --> 30:09.820
♪ Look up at my dream; so blue ♪

30:10.360 --> 30:11.670
♪ There are countless tests ♪

30:10.800 --> 30:14.520
[Class Break]

30:12.150 --> 30:13.670
♪ Different answers ♪

30:14.750 --> 30:16.830
♪ Life doesn't only have regrets ♪

30:16.560 --> 30:18.530
[Class Break]

30:17.440 --> 30:22.390
♪ What shines brightly about us
is our courage ♪

30:47.700 --> 30:50.540
[Let's celebrate the school anniversary
of Nanhai No. 1 High School]

31:07.110 --> 31:07.790
What?

31:09.230 --> 31:10.350
How could this be?

31:13.180 --> 31:13.980
What's wrong?

31:15.510 --> 31:16.830
Wind said he's not coming.

31:16.830 --> 31:17.890
Wind's not coming.

31:18.000 --> 31:19.070
He's going to

31:19.070 --> 31:20.590
an indie music festival.

31:20.720 --> 31:21.880
He's going to play real rock.

31:21.880 --> 31:23.540
He's leaving this afternoon.

31:23.720 --> 31:24.880
When will he be back?

31:24.880 --> 31:26.210
He said he doesn't know.

31:28.880 --> 31:30.440
A band without a guitarist—

31:30.440 --> 31:31.880
what kind of band is that?

31:39.070 --> 31:41.200
I wonder if I can fill in.

31:42.350 --> 31:45.150
You're just a cardboard horse
for entertainment.

31:45.350 --> 31:46.070
Do you know

31:46.070 --> 31:47.750
how important Wind is to us?

31:49.030 --> 31:51.640
He's the only professional among us.

31:52.440 --> 31:55.440
But it's too late for us
to change the performance now.

31:55.810 --> 31:57.210
I learn things very fast.

31:57.440 --> 31:58.910
I can skip sleep just to practice.

31:58.910 --> 32:00.570
And I've learned the bass before.

32:00.570 --> 32:02.500
I have some basic music knowledge.

32:03.350 --> 32:05.350
Although these two instruments look alike,

32:05.350 --> 32:08.010
they are different
when you actually play them.

32:09.590 --> 32:12.880
All our days of rehearsal will be wasted.

32:15.200 --> 32:17.730
Can you stop shouting
with that broken voice?

32:17.790 --> 32:19.050
Can't you trust me for once?

32:19.050 --> 32:20.050
At least let me...

32:20.070 --> 32:21.160
Let me try.

32:28.200 --> 32:29.930
There's no other way right now.

32:31.400 --> 32:32.800
We can let Duan Qiyan try.

32:42.960 --> 32:43.750
Duan Qiyan,

32:45.000 --> 32:47.260
you must be prepared to endure hardship.

32:48.830 --> 32:49.680
Yes!

32:50.000 --> 32:50.830
Zhixia,

32:51.030 --> 32:52.560
I owe you my life twice over.

32:55.200 --> 32:56.110
Sir.

32:57.810 --> 32:59.270
Returning it so soon?

33:00.160 --> 33:01.590
Your lease isn't up yet.

33:03.960 --> 33:05.880
I can't get used to playing the bass.

33:05.880 --> 33:07.610
I'll switch back to the guitar.

33:08.510 --> 33:09.120
Okay.

33:11.210 --> 33:12.460
Here, take this.

33:19.720 --> 33:20.530
Sir,

33:22.350 --> 33:24.000
where is "Do" on this guitar?

33:26.020 --> 33:29.250
[Lead Guitar Licks]

33:31.200 --> 33:32.720
Duan, let's go.

33:32.750 --> 33:33.920
Let's go play basketball.

33:33.920 --> 33:35.850
How can I play with my injured hand?

33:37.440 --> 33:38.550
Didn't you say that

33:38.640 --> 33:39.830
a hand injury is nothing,

33:39.830 --> 33:41.400
and you wouldn't complain
even if covered in bruises?

33:41.400 --> 33:42.640
Is that the same?

33:42.640 --> 33:44.160
Go ahead. Leave me alone.

33:44.200 --> 33:44.960
I'm leaving.

33:48.030 --> 33:49.110
Really?

33:49.680 --> 33:51.280
Why haven't I heard about it?

33:59.790 --> 34:02.250
How did Duan Qiyan's fingers
get so worn out?

34:03.350 --> 34:04.400
Learning an instrument

34:04.400 --> 34:05.880
requires hard work.

34:06.000 --> 34:07.640
The guitar relies mainly on the fingers

34:07.640 --> 34:09.969
rubbing against the strings repeatedly.

34:10.440 --> 34:12.550
Just like working out builds muscle,

34:13.030 --> 34:14.360
to play the guitar well,

34:14.510 --> 34:17.370
you have to build up calluses
on your fingers first.

34:18.230 --> 34:20.560
You've played the piano, so you must know.

34:22.800 --> 34:24.070
But if this continues,

34:24.070 --> 34:26.550
he definitely won't be able
to perform on stage.

34:26.550 --> 34:29.010
We need to find a way
for him to learn quickly.

34:30.230 --> 34:32.880
Can there be any shortcuts to this?

34:34.480 --> 34:35.360
You know music.

34:35.440 --> 34:36.880
Teach me after school.

34:50.320 --> 34:51.449
Sounds good, right?

34:52.190 --> 34:53.050
It sounds good.

34:53.440 --> 34:55.230
But you can actually try

34:55.230 --> 34:56.670
playing with all 5 fingers together,

34:56.670 --> 34:58.200
and keep your hands lifted.

35:04.710 --> 35:06.110
How do I keep them lifted?

35:08.590 --> 35:09.150
Just...

35:09.480 --> 35:10.340
I'll teach you.

35:10.960 --> 35:12.510
Right, lift it up a bit.

35:12.630 --> 35:13.510
Lift it up.

35:13.880 --> 35:14.550
Then,

35:14.550 --> 35:16.350
right, use every finger to play.

35:16.440 --> 35:17.230
Right.

35:17.930 --> 35:18.860
A little higher.

36:03.800 --> 36:04.440
What about the left hand?

36:04.440 --> 36:05.900
How should I place my left hand?

36:05.900 --> 36:07.760
I-It's the same for the left hand.

36:08.070 --> 36:09.630
Just... rest it here,

36:09.630 --> 36:10.890
and lift it up a little.

36:23.110 --> 36:24.710
Is it the same for the guitar?

36:26.920 --> 36:28.110
Not quite.

36:28.800 --> 36:31.530
But piano and guitar
are actually quite similar.

36:32.360 --> 36:33.150
Look,

36:33.510 --> 36:34.800
the C chord on a piano

36:34.800 --> 36:36.960
is playing Do, Mi, Sol together.

36:39.070 --> 36:41.110
The C chord on a guitar
is also Do, Mi, Sol.

36:41.110 --> 36:42.190
It's just that on a piano,

36:42.190 --> 36:43.510
you press the keys,

36:43.510 --> 36:45.110
while on a guitar, you strum.

36:55.710 --> 36:57.400
Is it possible

36:57.630 --> 36:58.840
that there is something

36:58.840 --> 37:00.840
that can play a chord with one press?

37:04.360 --> 37:05.800
How would you

37:06.550 --> 37:08.010
make this one-press chord

37:08.360 --> 37:09.510
work?

37:10.920 --> 37:12.650
I haven't figured that out yet.

37:12.960 --> 37:14.920
I just feel there must be a device

37:14.920 --> 37:16.320
that can replace fingers

37:16.630 --> 37:18.360
and play a chord with one press.

37:22.330 --> 37:24.680
I think we can give it a try.

37:44.840 --> 37:52.460
♪ Wandering light wind
drifts past your pupils ♪

37:53.620 --> 37:57.940
♪ One second of encounter,
heartstrings stirred ♪

37:58.470 --> 38:01.830
♪ The story feels altogether different ♪

38:04.040 --> 38:11.780
♪ How to describe
my whimsical wandering dream? ♪

38:13.030 --> 38:17.250
♪ You softly answer my quirky side ♪

38:17.640 --> 38:20.980
♪ Such bliss to finally be understood ♪

38:21.170 --> 38:23.090
Through repeated attempts,

38:22.450 --> 38:26.790
♪ The moment our eyes met,
my world came alive with color ♪

38:23.940 --> 38:24.940
Jiang Yubai and I

38:25.280 --> 38:27.460
actually made a one-press chord device.

38:27.460 --> 38:31.830
♪ Could this be how love begins? ♪

38:29.420 --> 38:30.440
At that time,

38:30.760 --> 38:32.980
we just thought it was a temporary fix.

38:32.350 --> 38:35.330
♪ These unspoken feelings
are so hard to figure out ♪

38:35.500 --> 38:36.960
But years later, I finally understood.

38:35.910 --> 38:41.230
♪ Hidden deep within your gaze ♪

38:37.940 --> 38:39.010
True rock and roll

38:39.590 --> 38:41.520
is never about perfect technique,

38:41.630 --> 38:46.020
♪ Sometimes, I imagine
drifting beyond the skies with you ♪

38:42.230 --> 38:43.480
but the passion of a group of people

38:43.480 --> 38:45.190
who forge ahead

38:45.570 --> 38:47.550
through messy trials.

38:46.600 --> 38:50.830
♪ Shimmering light
dances over the flower in bloom ♪

38:49.360 --> 38:50.150
Now,

38:50.150 --> 38:51.920
there are more ways to learn the guitar.

38:51.310 --> 38:54.450
♪ After all we've been through,
our fates remain intertwined ♪

38:53.590 --> 38:55.690
But I miss the times
during the school anniversary so much.

38:55.200 --> 39:01.630
♪ Perhaps fate favors me now ♪

38:57.300 --> 38:59.840
Those youthful days

39:00.570 --> 39:02.670
that could be ignited with one press...
